Package: @BINPKG@-modules
Architecture: arm64
Section: kernel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}@DKMS_META_DEPENDS@
Description: Qualcomm ARM64 out-of-tree kernel modules (meta-package)
 This meta-package always depends on every out-of-tree module meta-package
 built for the latest kernel image of this variant, so installing it alongside
 @BINPKG@ pulls in the full module set and keeps it in step with the kernel
 across apt upgrades.
